{
  "id": "hold-brackets",
  "language": "python",
  "kind": "existing",
  "split": "holdout",
  "title": "Delimiter validation",
  "trigger": "active_check",
  "requirements": [
    "data 是字符串，检查 () [] {} 是否正确嵌套。初始忽略双引号字符串内的括号，支持反斜杠转义；未闭合字符串返回 false。",
    "修复当前实现不区分括号种类的问题。"
  ],
  "correction": "增加忽略 // 行注释；注释在换行结束。字符串中的 // 不是注释。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for hold-brackets: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "balanced",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "[{}()]"
      },
      "expected": true,
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "mismatch",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "([)]"
      },
      "expected": false,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "comment",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "() // ["
      },
      "expected": true,
      "public": true,
      "before": false
    },
    {
      "id": "next-line",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "// }\n[]"
      },
      "expected": true,
      "public": false,
      "before": false
    },
    {
      "id": "quoted",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "\"[//]\"{}"
      },
      "expected": true,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "unclosed",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": "\"abc"
      },
      "expected": false,
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
